BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Kayaking Sonoma County & Beyond
UID:event_316660253@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261017T041353Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T160000
SUMMARY:Richardson Bay
DESCRIPTION:Kayaking Sonoma County & Beyond\n**EVENT CANCELED**\n\n**DESCR
 IPTION**\n**Lets go enjoy Richardson Bay.**\n**We will meet at Schoonmaker
  Beach.**\n**This is a nice sandy beach. A problem is that parking is a co
 nsiderable ways away.**\n**Make sure you bring a kayak cart.**\n**You can 
 also off load at the beach and then go park.**\n\n**Dunphy park is closed.
 **\n\n**From our launch site we will head out the bay towards downtown Sau
 salito and beyond.**\n\n**LAUNCH SITE**\n**Schoonmaker beach in Sausalito 
 also known as Sausalito Beach.**\n\n**PARKING**\n**Schoonmaker beach**\n**
 Parking will be at the bay model parking lot.**\n**Parking is free and the
 re is usually plenty of places to park.**\n\n**Skills Sheet**\n[North Bay 
 Kayakers - Skill Sheet](https://drive.google.com/file/d/1eeMvKc4JCaJz7K4Da
 NpS567tyUT5IUGc/view?usp=sharing)\n\n**LIABILITY RELEASE**\n**Please fill 
 out and bring the signed hard copy to the event.**\n**DO NOT** **email me 
 a copy of the liability release form. I need to have the hard copy at the 
 event.**\n[LIABILITY RELEASE](https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Guu1nO73vW9
 cjalZeXK90zO5eONk-xs9/view?usp=sharing)\n\n**BOAT REQUIREMENTS**\n**No inf
 latables\, or folding Kayaks**\n**SUP's Please call me to discuss.**\n**Si
 t on Top and Closed Deck kayaks are best for this event.**\n\n**SCHEDULE**
 \n**9:30 am meet on the beach.**\n**10:00am Pre paddle meeting and OTW (on
  the water)**\n**If you need more time to set up your boat\, please arrive
  earlier.**\n**We will be on the water (OTW) on time.**\n**4:00pm** ***app
 roximate*** **return time to the beach.**\n\n**WHAT TO BRING**\n**Kayak\, 
 Paddle**\n**PFD (must be worn while we are on the water)**\n**Water\, Lunc
 h\, Snacks**\n**VHF radio if you have one**\n**Dry change of clothes in a 
 dry bag in your boat.**\n**Dry change of clothes in your car for after the
  paddle.**\n**paddle float**\n**bilge pump**\n**spray skirt**\n**Wet suit 
 or dry suit**\n***Call me if you need any of the above items.***\n\n**REMI
 NDERS**\n**You can never have to many layers to put on when you get cold.*
 *\n\n**QUESTIONS OR CONCERNS**\n**Please contact me.**\n**Brent Swinth**\n
 **707 867 8166**\n\n***********\n\n************\\*****\\*****\\*****\\****
 *\\*****\\*****\\*****\\*****\\*****\\*****\\*** **IMPORTANT PLEASE READ \
 \*****\\*****\\*****\\*****\\*****\\*****\\*****\\*****\\*****\\*****\\***
 **\\*****\\*****\\*****\\*********\n**In RSVP'ing for this event you are d
 eclaring that the organizer\, event hosts\, and leaders of North Bay Kayak
 ers are not responsible and/or liable for anything that happens to you or 
 your gear. YOU are responsible and Liable for your own safety and the safe
 ty of your gear. If you are bringing a guest then you are taking full resp
 onsibility and liability for them and their gear and anything that they do
 .**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/kayaking-sonoma-beyond/events/3166602
 53/
